      "dialogue": {
        "speaker": {
          "garden_keeper": "Lian"
        },
        "tutorial_intro": {
          "001": "Signal just came in, and it already smells fishy, doesn’t it? Still, I doubt it’ll be a waste of time.\nThing is, the signal’s pretty unstable. If your ship systems aren’t properly tuned up, you might run into trouble out there.\n\nDon’t forget to run maintenance before you head out.\n\nWouldn’t want you coming back as a heap of scrap."
        }
